        "notes": "A magnitude 9.0 rupture of the Cascadia subduction zone as it affects Portland, set at 2 PM PST on Monday 1 February 2027 as a scenario choice and not a prediction. The run begins a month before, on 1 January 2027, and ends a year after the earthquake. Ground motion, soils (saturated) and the building inventory with daytime occupants are DOGAMI's; tanks, bridges, transmission structures and route segments are damaged as components; water follows an assumed schedule. Every constant is published, recalled or declared a guess in its module's description.",
